5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,The morning shoving match is unacceptable. I need to know the physical reality of the rows.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I am concerned about the financial burden. Who actually pays when a space is empty?,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,I suspect the current allocation is biased. I want to see if the history matches the grumbling.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,I worry about social friction. I need to know what happens when this arrangement bites.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Mio,,I hate that jobs quietly lapse. I need to know the actual effort required to keep this running.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Ryuji, money is important, but if the bikes are wet, the argument starts before the invoice.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Asuka, wet bikes are a nuisance. Unpaid bills are a crisis. I need the ledger.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,George,,"@Shunichi, friction is real. But I need proof that the same doors always get the good spots.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@George, proof is good. But I need to know if the current setup is already causing resentment.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Ryuji, I agree. If we don't know the cost, we can't plan. I'll check the complaint log.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I will check the rain exposure and the morning departures. I need to see the physical chaos.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I will check the building ledger and the ward cycle park. I need to compare costs.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,George,,I will check the five years of minutes and the sticker register. I need to see the history.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I will check the complaint log and the neighbouring block's account. I need to see the fallout.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Mio,,I will check the treasurer's file and the supplier's frame trial. I need to see the workload.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
