70,3,3,talk,Asuka,,I am voting C. It is the fairest way to assign the spots.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Ryuji,,I am voting A. It covers the costs and gives people a stake.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
